### ─── Skills ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List skills (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/skills?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a skill by slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/skills/react-usememo-deep-dive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Featured skills
GET {{baseUrl}}/skills/featured
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Semantic search
POST {{baseUrl}}/skills/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "query": "React performance optimization hooks",
  "limit": 10,
  "min_score": 0.6
}

### Create a skill
POST {{baseUrl}}/skills
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "React useMemo deep-dive",
  "slug": "react-usememo-deep-dive",
  "description": "A practical guide to React useMemo with examples",
  "content": "# React useMemo\n\n...",
  "category_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "tags": ["react", "performance"],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "is_public": true
}

### Update a skill
PUT {{baseUrl}}/skills/react-usememo-deep-dive
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "description": "Updated description",
  "is_featured": true
}

### Delete a skill
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/skills/react-usememo-deep-dive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
